    "lesson": {
      "title": "How long must the ladder be?",
      "instruction": "Move the foot farther from the wall. How does the ladder change?",
      "explanation": "The wall and ground form a right angle. The Pythagorean theorem gives a\u00b2 + b\u00b2 = c\u00b2; take the square root to find the ladder length. This geometric model does not determine safe ladder placement."
